<title>USA: HarCor Energy announces possible sale.</title>
<headline>HarCor Energy announces possible sale.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>HarCor Energy Inc said late Thursday that it has engaged Dillon, Read &amp; Co to help it pursue strategic alternatives that include a possible sale of the company.</p>
<p>The Houston-based independent energy company reported 1995 revenues of nearly $23 million.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
